DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42156::$$$message_0265_0000_0000$$$::"Now, preparations for dinner are complete, the castle has been cleaned, and our mistress is doing homework in her chambers."::
42157::$$$message_0265_0000_0001$$$::"Hehe. It's all perfect.[lr]::
42158::$$$message_0265_0000_0002$$$::I think I'll be able to take it easy today. Perhaps I'll enjoy tending to the garden."::
42159::$$$message_0265_0001_0000$$$::"Sella, Sella. I just heard some amazing news."::
42160::$$$message_0265_0001_0001$$$::"...[wvs][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HMED1_SER_0050 _name=セラ]Ahem.[lr]::
42161::$$$message_0265_0001_0002$$$::What is it, Leysritt? How many times do I have to tell you not to run in the castle?"::
42162::$$$message_0265_0002_0000$$$::"But we have to hurry.[lr]::
42163::$$$message_0265_0002_0001$$$::Look at this, Sella. Someone stuck it to the gate."::
42164::$$$message_0265_0002_0002$$$::"The gate...?[lr]::
42165::$$$message_0265_0002_0003$$$::Show me."::
42166::$$$message_0265_0002_0004$$$::"'One night stay at an onsen resort. I know your secret. The Einzbern maids are invited for an exclusive complimentary stay, but the offer ends today...'"::
42167::$$$message_0265_0002_0005$$$::"...An invitation, then?[lr]::
42168::$$$message_0265_0002_0006$$$::It's suspicious... But it does bear the Einzbern seal."::
42169::$$$message_0265_0002_0007$$$::"Yeah. I bet Grandpa Acht is giving us a day off.[lr]::
42170::$$$message_0265_0002_0008$$$::Let's go, Sella. Onsen, onsen."::
42171::$$$message_0265_0002_0009$$$::"...Leysritt.[lr]::
42172::$$$message_0265_0002_0010$$$::Just to be sure, is the mistress studying in her room?"::
42173::$$$message_0265_0002_0011$$$::"Yeah. Once she's done, she'll eat dinner and go to bed."::
42174::$$$message_0265_0002_0012$$$::"...Very well.[lr]::
42175::$$$message_0265_0002_0013$$$::We will allow the castle to take care of her for one day only."::
42176::$$$message_0265_0002_0014$$$::"We mustn't squander our lord's graciousness."@&u6